<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.10">
<l>ceruvāḷum puḷḷāḷaṉ maṇṇāḷaṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">cerucceyyum nānta kameṉṉum</l>
<l>oruvāḷaṉ maṟaiyāḷa ṉōṭāta</l>
<l rend="indent">paṭaiyāḷaṉ viḻukkai yāḷaṉ</l>
<l>iravāḷaṉ pakalāḷa ṉeṉṉaiyāḷaṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">ēḻulakap perumpu ravāḷaṉ</l>
<l>tiruvāḷa ṉiṉitākat tirukkaṇkaḷ</l>
<l rend="indent">vaḷarkiṉṟa tiruva raṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Master of the bird who dominates in battle, master of the earth,</l>
<l>master of the one called Nāndaka that does battle,</l>
<l>master of the Vedas, master of the undefeated armies,</l>
<l>strong armed master, master of darkness, master of the day,</l>
<l>master of me,</l>
<l>master of [all] the great places of the seven worlds,</l>
<l>master of Śrī –</l>
<l rend="indent">holy Araṅkam is where [he] sweetly rests [his] divine eyes.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
